00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:56.160
Mana Nagase's
Autograph

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:56.160
I'll keep quiet.

00:13:56.160 --> 00:14:01.700
She was an amazing idol,
even to her sister's eyes, right?

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:03.450
Well of course!

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:05.620
Her voice, her smile!

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:09.450
Anyone would be captivated by her,
seeing her up close.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:12.120
That is why Kotono,
you must take up her mantle--

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:14.290
Stop.

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:16.450
Kotono?

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:17.990
I'm sorry.

00:14:17.990 --> 00:14:20.330
I'm gonna go back to my room now.

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.200
Suzu...

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:30.290
W-Was it my fault?!

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:33.950
No, I wasn't being mindful enough, either.

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:36.370
To take up the mantle
of such a great idol...

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:39.160
She must be feeling incredible pressure.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:42.660
Do you think Kotono's mad?

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:43.990
No.

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:46.910
I don't think she is.

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:51.990
I think she ran away because she felt
responsible for making it awkward.

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:53.950
Ran away...?

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:57.450
Kotono's always been a little complicated.

00:14:57.450 --> 00:14:59.370
Smiling when it's not fun for her,

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:01.910
and acting like she's interested
when she's not...

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:04.290
She doesn't like doing that.

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:06.950
So she'd rather leave like she did now.

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:09.580
I wonder if she'll be able
to work with us like that.

00:15:09.580 --> 00:15:10.830
I know, right?

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:14.080
But I think she knows this herself, too.

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:17.910
I personally like people like that.

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:28.450
We made it through the whole song already!

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:30.330
Barely, yeah.

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:33.410
We're still off rhythm and all over the place.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:35.490
But it sure is fun.

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:37.790
Kotono, what's the matter?

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:43.200
Will I really be able to catch up
to my sister at this slow pace?

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:44.200
What?

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:46.490
Sorry!

00:15:46.490 --> 00:15:48.490
I'm gonna go get some fresh air.

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:52.450
Kotono...?

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:00.290
One of your idols?

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:01.490
LizNoir...?

00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:03.290
Kotono, what's the matter?

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:04.910
Oh... It's nothing.

00:16:04.910 --> 00:16:07.490
Sorry to startle you. They're my guests.

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:11.580
They stopped by to say hi for old time's sake.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:12.830
Mr. Saegusa.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:14.160
I'm...

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:16.410
That matter is done.

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:18.620
I don't intend on returning to Van Productions.

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:23.540
What if we leave Van Productions
and transfer here?

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:25.290
Give me a break.

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:28.660
I have no desire to rock the boat
with Asakura any further.

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:32.040
Then, how do you explain Mana Nagase?

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:33.620
You're the one who made her.

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:34.870
Big Sister...?

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:36.740
Big Sister?

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:39.240
So you are Mana Nagase's...

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:41.240
Yes, I am her sister.

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:43.240
You do resemble her.

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:44.330
This is perfect.

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:47.990
Could you watch their lesson as a favor?

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:48.610
What?

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:50.660
Mr. Saegusa, what are you--?

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:52.290
What do you think, Kotono?

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:53.990
If you're aiming for the top,

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:58.200
don't you want to steal
whatever you can get from LizNoir?

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.620
The top...?

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:02.200
I understand.

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.870
Please watch us.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:06.790
Th-Things just got serious...

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:53.370
Well, as you can see,

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:55.990
they're just beginners who just started lessons.

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:57.740
That's all right.

00:17:57.740 --> 00:18:00.410
We all start out as beginners.

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:04.700
Could Rio and I dance through it once?

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:05.540
What?

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:10.080
You two have yet to watch
the example video for the song, right?

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:11.450
It's not necessary.

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:13.950
But how could you dance without it?

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:15.870
They can... probably.

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:17.080
What?

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:19.240
LizNoir is the real deal.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:23.410
They were always in competition
with Miss Mana.

00:19:23.870 --> 00:19:25.870
A-Amazing...

00:19:53.950 --> 00:19:55.330
That's right...

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:59.450
This is what idols are!

00:20:07.410 --> 00:20:10.580
This is what... idols are...

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:24.450
Now...

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:26.740
Let's try it together, shall we?

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:27.990
Yes!

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.490
President's Office

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:33.120
So, what did you think?

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:35.740
If they're trying to make it to
the top of the Venus Program,

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:38.540
they'd get there quicker with us.

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:39.950
You're right.

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:42.910
But that'd be boring, don't you think?

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:45.990
I'll make you regret this no matter what.

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:57.490
How did the lesson with LizNoir go?

00:20:57.490 --> 00:21:00.830
To be honest, they were on
a whole other level...

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.990
But you can't reach the top
unless you surpass them.

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:09.330
But I had a lot of fun.

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:10.290
Huh?

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.660
The LizNoir duo was incredible!

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:14.580
They showed me what idols are...

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:17.410
Miss Mana must've been incredible, too!

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:19.540
Of course she was!

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:20.950
That's right!

00:21:20.950 --> 00:21:23.740
I want to practice even more,

00:21:23.740 --> 00:21:27.620
and work hard to become idols like them!

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:32.290
Mr. Makino.

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:35.870
What can we do to win?

00:21:35.870 --> 00:21:37.660
Kotono...

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:39.290
I already told you.

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:46.330
Shi-Shizuku...

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:50.040
You recorded their dance, right?

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:51.290
I did...

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:53.330
And the lesson after that...

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:56.080
Why don't we watch them together?

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:59.790
I thought we could do a review meeting...

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:01.740
Yeah! That's a great idea!

00:22:01.740 --> 00:22:06.370
Yeah, we should review our good
points and bad points together.

00:22:06.370 --> 00:22:08.580
Oh, I'm making the wrong pose.

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:10.700
Right off the bat?! How sloppy!

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:13.120
You missed, too, Suzu.

00:22:13.120 --> 00:22:17.120
Everyone's Looking for the Answer

00:22:13.120 --> 00:22:15.930
All right, let's review it
from the beginning.

00:22:14.660 --> 00:22:17.120
You've got this, everyone!
